[statement]
A `!` entry with no constraint forbids a package providing the name at no
version: asked for `app` and for `p1`, apk refuses.

[repository]
P:app
V:1
D:!y

P:p1
V:1
k:5
p:y

[request]
app
p1

[answer apk-tools 3.0.9-r0]
| ERROR: unable to select packages:
|   p1-1:
|     breaks: app-1[!y]
|     satisfies: world[p1]
refused
